- New zombie bird location on Level 6;
- New localization: Simplified Chinese;
- New localization: Traditional Chinese;
- Improved gamepad controls;
- New settings window;
- New help window (in Pause);
- Minor bug fixes and improvements.

Get 60% off on ZD: Pixel Survival: 

https://store.steampowered.com/app/1271690/Zombie_Derby_Pixel_Survival/

Enjoy the game! 😎
